    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: 'Primary path: author in plain English with the Claude skill traverse-capability-author, then land a human-reviewed PR in traverse-framework/registry. Secondary path: implement manually in Rust, meet coverage and CI gates, and use the documented publish path so artifact digests survive review. After merge, the capability appears in the next public catalog release — there is no side-door upload.',
